#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:1
msgid "Changyang Campus"
msgstr "长阳创谷"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:4
msgid "长阳创谷"
msgstr "长阳创谷"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Yangpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜杨浦区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Hardware AI."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI软件、AI硬件。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Yangpu brain-inspired intelligence plan identifies Changyang Campus "
"as a southern core, paired with Bay Valley in the north. Suitable for "
"neuromorphic computing and commercial AI collaborations."
msgstr "杨浦类脑智能行动方案中的南部核心载体，与北部湾谷科技园联动。可关注类脑计算及AI产业合作。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S016 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250627/db116dceccb04e28b1a22c5b22612c63.html>`_. "
"关于印发《杨浦区关于促进类脑智能产业发展的实施方案》的通知."
msgstr "`资料来源 S016 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250627/db116dceccb04e28b1a22c5b22612c63.html>`_. 关于印发《杨浦区关于促进类脑智能产业发展的实施方案》的通知."

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250627/db116dceccb04e28b1a22c5b22612c63.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方资料及主管部门 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250627/db116dceccb04e28b1a22c5b22612c63.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:35
msgid "Send a project brief and request the current admission checklist."
msgstr "发送项目简介，索取最新入驻条件及材料清单。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete the operator's eligibility and technical or commercial review."
msgstr "按运营机构要求完成资格审核及技术或商业评审。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm rent, service fees, IP, compute pricing and any equity rights in "
"writing."
msgstr "书面确认租金、服务费、知识产权、算力价格及股权相关条款。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:41
msgid ""
"Sign the agreed admission documents and record milestones and support "
"owners."
msgstr "签署入驻协议，明确阶段目标和服务对接人。"

#: ../../entities/changyang.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Yangpu district route </districts/yangpu>`"
msgstr ":doc:`杨浦区合作指南 </districts/yangpu>`"

